<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells PLN 432 mln 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells PLN 432 mln 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 432 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills on Friday after Polish banks bid for 433 million, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The average yield for the paper held unchanged at 22.20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
